6022	`patterns` (TS-only) walks `dir` for `LanguageId::TypeScript` files, runs `inspection::inspect_files_with_registry`, and aggregates counts into `PatternsResult`. Adds extended hook tracking (`useContext`, `useReducer`, `useMemo`, `useSuspense`), `hoc_count`/`lazy_count`/`zod_usage` from `is_hoc`/`is_lazy`/non-empty `zod_schemas`, plus toolchain accumulation (first-seen build tool, first-seen test runner, deduplicated types).
