## Audit Findings — SPEC-006 (CodeBlock/RankedBlock/ParentContext/Diagnostic/DiagnosticKind/LineHit)

I cross-checked all 15 criteria against `docs/spec/01-core-architecture.md:454-603` (verbatim struct text confirmed above) and against `SPEC-003.json` / `SPEC-005.json` for scope overlap. Field lists, derive headers, serde attributes, and the flatten key-collision claim in AC-001–AC-015 all check out against source. The issues below are the substantive gaps.

```json
{
