      "suggested_fix": "Add to T-005's green step a source-anchored check of every pin against the eight prose bullets at 01-core-architecture.md:3071-3078. The bullets are backtick-delimited TOML fragments, so extract and compare them directly: `diff <(awk '/^Relevant workspace dependencies for monokl \\(versions\\):/{f=1;next} f&&/^- /{gsub(/`/,\"\\n\");print} f&&/^$/&&seen{exit}' /Users/gabe/Projects/monokl/docs/spec/01-core-architecture.md | grep -E '^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+ = ' | sort) <(sed -n '/^\\[workspace.dependencies\\]$/,$p' /Users/gabe/Projects/monokl/Cargo.toml | grep -E '^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+ = ' | sort)` expecting no output, exit 0. Also add a matching `grep -c 'Workspace .resolver = \"3\"., .members = \\[\"crates/\\*\"\\].' docs/spec/01-core-architecture.md` expecting `1` to T-001's green step to ground AC-021 in the source rather than the heredoc."
