      "task_id": "T-017",
      "type": "missing",
      "description": "lib.rs (AC-014) is never compared against docs/spec/01-core-architecture.md. T-017's green step diffs the written file only against a heredoc re-typed inside the plan, plus four counts (14 pub mod, 1 tests_types, 3 lang-ts gates, 2 cli gates) that are all insensitive to module ordering and to which module carries which gate. This is precisely the defect class fix #4 corrected for the root Cargo.toml (T-001/T-003) and fix #7/T-023 corrected for the crate Cargo.toml -- the propagation stopped short of lib.rs. T-023 copies lib.rs into /tmp/mk_struct but only for path resolution; it never diffs it against the doc, and the plan explicitly never compiles it. A single transcription deviation in the plan's own heredoc (a reordered `pub mod`, a gate attached to the wrong module, an altered comment line) would produce a file that satisfies every check in the plan while diverging from the locked source.",
